WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,960
It's not that there's not enough money

2
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:02,760
The space is almost full

3
00:00:13,340 --> 00:00:15,980
Seafood, raw meat and frozen products will be delivered tomorrow

4
00:00:16,340 --> 00:00:17,660
All others are settled today

5
00:00:30,670 --> 00:00:32,630
Priority is given to cooked food in time-barred areas

6
00:00:33,230 --> 00:00:34,350
Fresh produce and saplings

7
00:00:34,550 --> 00:00:38,010
If rice, flour, grains, oils, and daily necessities are not easily damaged, put them in the courtyard.

8
00:00:38,860 --> 00:00:40,300
This has the highest space utilization

9
00:00:42,770 --> 00:00:43,730
At this speed

10
00:00:43,930 --> 00:00:45,490
What's left won't last long

11
00:00:46,010 --> 00:00:48,500
How can I open it?

12
00:00:48,780 --> 00:00:50,100
If you can't open it, pile it up high first.

13
00:00:50,700 --> 00:00:51,700
The most important thing now is

14
00:00:51,700 --> 00:00:52,780
Buy what you can buy first

15
00:00:53,020 --> 00:00:54,660
We will study the issue of space later.
